"entity": {
"name": "Irish Continental Group PLC",
"description": "Irish Continental Group Plc engages in the provision of logistic management services. It operates through following segments: Ferries and Container and Terminal. The Ferries segment is involved in the operation of combined Roll on Roll off passenger ferries and the chartering vessels. The Container and Terminal segment provides door-to-door and feeder Lift on Lift off freight services, stevedoring, and other related terminal services. The company was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.",
